SUMMARY:LOUDLANDS Holiday Showcase
LOCATION:The Rockwell\, 255 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the holiday season with friends and family supporting
  our Loudlands students as they show off the songs they’ve been working 
 on! Our Holiday Showcase features individual performances from drummers\, 
 guitarists\, vocalists\, bassists\, pianists\, and more\, giving you the g
 reatest gift of all: a day full of live music. Everyone’s invited to che
 er on our growing Loudlands artists. Come enjoy an inspiring performance a
 nd close out the year with us!\nhttps://therockwell.org/calendar/loudlands
 -holiday-showcase-2/\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
