SUMMARY:The Sloppy Boys
LOCATION:The Rockwell\, 255 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:The Sloppy Boys are a Los Feliz\, California based party rock b
 and comprised of Mike Hanford\, Jefferson Dutton\, and Tim Kalpakis from t
 he comedy group The Birthday Boys. In 2022\, the boys travelled to the leg
 endary Sonic Ranch Studios where they teamed with super-producer Money Mar
 k (Beastie Boys\, Beck) to record their fourth album Sonic Ranch. The enti
 re process was filmed by director Robert Holguin for his feature length co
 medy-rock-doc Blood\, Sweat and Beers or How The Sloppy Boys Made an Album
  on a Farm in West Texas.\nhttps://therockwell.org/calendar/the-sloppy-boy
 s/\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
URL:https://therockwell.org/calendar/the-sloppy-boys/
END:VEVENT
